  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2018;YOUNG CREATIVES&#x2019;: EMPOWERING CHILDREN FROM UNDERPRIVILEGED COMMUNITIES IN UPPER EGYPT THROUGH ARTS AND CULTURE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is intended to address the challenges of limited access to books, arts education, and quality cultural services for children and adolescents living in underprivileged remote communities in Upper Egypt, particularly in the governorate of Assiut, by breaking down cost and proximity barriers, promoting a reading culture, and bringing books and arts to areas where they are scarce.</narrative>
  </description>
